<title>USA: Missouri lean hog carcass values - Dec 12.</title>
<headline>Missouri lean hog carcass values - Dec 12.</headline>
<dateline>JEFFERSON CITY, MO 1996-12-12</dateline>
<text>
<p>Plant delivered prices on lean slaughter hogs were $1.00 lower than Wednesday's close. -USDA</p>
<p>Price range (dollars/cwt) -</p>
<p>-- 49-50 percent lean, carcass weight of 167-187 lbs</p>
<p>	 77.62-78.37</p>
<p>-- 51-52 percent lean with a carcass weight of 175-180 lbs</p>
<p>	 74.53-79.37</p>
<p>Estimated Receipts: 1,000</p>
<p>Note: Producer reported prices with grade premiums or discounts included.</p>
<p>Source: Missouri Department of Agriculture-USDA Livestock Market News</p>
<p>(Chicago newsdesk 312 408 8720)</p>
